# The image only needs the package manifests (for rosdep) and the files the
# Dockerfile COPYs explicitly; the sources are bind-mounted at runtime.
# Allowlist, so bags/datasets/build outputs never end up in a layer.
**
!franka_entrypoint.sh
!franka.repos
!**/package.xml
!**/COLCON_IGNORE
!**/AMENT_IGNORE
!**/CATKIN_IGNORE
build/
install/
log/
